<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ITI Technologies.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ITI Technologies.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Piper Jaffray said it upgraded ITI Technologies Inc to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- set a 1998 earnings estimate of $1.45 a share.</p>
<p>-- set a 12-month price target of $20.</p>
<p>-- cited ITI's proposed acquisition of CADDX, a private Texas-based manufacturer of hard-wired security alarm components and systems.</p>
<p>-- said expects deal will become accretive to quarterly earnings by about $0.03 to $0.04 a share starting in the third and fourth quarter.</p>
<p>-- ITI gained 1-7/8 to 16.</p>
</text>
